{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34016","headline":"寒日书斋即事三首 二 · 皮日休","name":"寒日书斋即事三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不知何事有生涯，皮褐亲裁学道家。\n深夜数瓯唯柏叶，清晨一器是云华。\n盆池有鹭窥苹沫，石版无人扫桂花。\n江汉欲归应未得，夜来频梦赤城霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}